cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RoboReel, please cite the paper below."
title: "Monkey See, Can Monkey Do? A Benchmark for Evaluating Robot Skill Learning by Observation"
abstract: >-
  RoboReel is a benchmark for learning robot manipulation skills from human
  demonstration video. Policies are conditioned on a human performing a task
  rather than on teleoperated robot trajectories, and evaluated in simulation
  across four test suites that vary visual distraction and object pose.
